+## 5. Rule-by-rule static soundness review
+
+### Exhaustive inventory
+
+The authoritative source inventory covers `semantics.k`, all 24 helper K files,
+`program.k`, `verification.k`, and `spec.k`. It contains 1,026 complete
+statements:
